<title>USA: Alliance Entertainment Corp Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Alliance Entertainment Corp Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $126.3	  $176.2</p>
<p>EBITDA (before</p>
<p>  non-recurring charges)		 (9.0)	     6.0</p>
<p> EBITDA					(9.0)	     3.1</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			(23.1)	   (4.6)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share	    (0.52)	  (0.13)</p>
<p>Weighted avg. shares</p>
<p>outstanding and</p>
<p>   equivalents			44,767,357    35,837,493</p>
<p>(In Millions except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTES: For the three months ended March 31, 1996, the company recorded charges totalling $2.9 million.</p>
<p>The charges consisted of $0.4 million relating to consolidation and $2.5 million in relating to termination of a merger pact with Metromedia International Group Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
